      "reviewId": "BV-1-34310561",
      "text": "I highly recommend this restaurant. I has a great atmosphere, truly unique! (hard to find in Miami) I love that I can pick out different things of the menu, wether light or more formal and still be surprised. I went with a couple of friends to have a glass of wine and tapas and we were all blown away. From the Lamb Soup to the Bavarois creme, we could not pass up at the end,- it was finger liking good! I ordered a simple House Salad and got an amazing mix of spinach, arugula, roasted red bell peppers, shaved parmesan cheese... wow! The \"bocaditos\", specially the morrocan lamb were also amazing. We were there for hours and never felt rushed-it's a place to have good convos, great food and a nice glass of wine! Will be back tonight!",
      "rating": {
