      "text": "Second time there... Great food.. I was going for the Chicken Tagine, instead he made a special Lamb Tagine, very, very good. Also had the \"Jarera\" which is like a Lamb Stew, delicious. Again, the Fennel Soup you must have. Finally their desserts are perfect, done by his wife with love and curiosity . And basically I recommend the Marroccan dishes in this place, rather than the French. Over all this is a local place that needs the the locals support. Thanks again.",
