      "reviewId": "BV-1-33723259",
      "text": "WOW! Great Place.\nIncredible and unique food. Never tried the CHICKEN TAGINE and Im hooked! My wife had the BURGER and for Burger Lovers please, this is the BEST BURGER you' ll have. Had an ONION SOUP and also, out of this world. The Chef sent us another soup to try and its a FENNEL SOUP that had never tried and if you havent, you are missing out. WE WHERE WELL TREATED, he also sent a Gizzard ? appetizer and it was superb. Home made desserts, 2 of them; a CHOCOLATE MOUSSE w/raspberry sauce, and a MANGO TART with real fruit both of them, simply DELICIOUS!!!.. Important tip, you can cap everything with nice ESPRESSO. Finally, THE WINE, great selection and really reasonable prices.\nCant wait for the BACK PATIO and summer to be finished.",
