      "reviewId": "BV-1-33359622",
      "text": "We dined for the first time at Rouge last night. I had been looking for a casual french bistro with reasonable prices. This is the place!! Food and service were both fantastic. Most expensive entree was $29 (bouillabaisse which was awesome). Rouge is run by a husband and wife team - he runs the kitchen and she manages the front of house. They opened 6 months ago and deserve support from local residents. This is not the kind of place that will be overrun by tourists....unless the French are in town! We can't wait to go back.",
